    "tag": "Midjourney · Chapter 7 · Part 1",
    "title": "Style Reference (--sref)",
    "body": [
      {
        "text": "If you want several images in the "
      },
      {
        "text": "same style",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " (like a brand image set), use "
      },
      {
        "text": "--sref [image link]",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " to lock the reference image's style, so a feed or album looks like one cohesive set. Very important for brand work."
      }
    ],
    "example": "coffee cup on table --sref [brand-style image link] --ar 1:1",
    "mascot": "mascot-read"
  },
  {
    "type": "theory",
    "tag": "Midjourney · Chapter 7 · Part 2",
    "title": "Character Reference (--cref)",
    "body": [
      {
        "text": "If you want the "
      },
